{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26831","headline":"和座主相公雨中作 · 姚合","name":"和座主相公雨中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清气润华屋，东风吹雨匀。\n花低惊艳重，竹净觉声真。\n山际凝如雾，云中散似尘。\n萧萧下碧落，点点救生民。\n缓洒雷霆细，微沾瓦砾新。\n诗成难继和，造化笔通神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}